    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 516,
    "bookid": 36,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Macroscopic appearance",
    "headingPosition": 11,
    "headingid": 555,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 70537,
        "bookId": 36,
        "chapterId": 222,
        "headingId": 555,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Myoid gonadal stromal tumours are unencapsulated and well circumscribed, with a yellow/tan appearance. The tumours measure 10&ndash;35&nbsp;mm {25319984; 21813158}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2022-02-22T11:57:18"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 510,
    "bookid": 36,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Histopathology",
    "headingPosition": 12,
    "headingid": 549,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 70538,
        "bookId": 36,
        "chapterId": 222,
        "headingId": 549,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>The tumours consist of short fascicles of spindled tumour cells that may surround residual seminiferous tubules, particularly in the periphery of the tumour {27801954}. The tumour cells are fusiform with scant to moderate and lightly eosinophilic cytoplasm. Tumour nuclei show no or only mild atypia; lymphovascular invasion and necrosis are absent. The mitotic count is variable {25319984; 21813158}.</p>\r\n<p>All reported tumours are positive for actin, S100, FOXL2, SF1, vimentin, inhibin (focal), and desmin {25319984}.</p>\r\n<p>At the ultrastructural level the tumour nuclei show occasional grooves, and the cells show scant cytoplasm rich in mitochondria, with small cytoskeletal myofilaments {33140129}. Myoid gonadal stromal tumours lack the broad fascicles, cigar-shaped nuclei, and perinuclear vacuoles seen in leiomyoma. The tumours are distinguished from fibroma by negativity for SOX9 and the absence of collagen bundles forming hyaline plaques.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2022-02-22T11:57:18"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 511,
    "bookid": 36,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Cytology",
